#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:192
msgid ""
"Local accounts have no Gateway inference. A model lookup raises "
"`ModelConnectionRequired`. Job, turn and model-preference requests answer"
" 409 `model_connection_required`, a waiting message is held with that "
"reason, and `GET /v1/agent/config` reports `model_connection_required: "
"true` with no models. A Gateway grant is never minted for a local "
"account, and its ID is never sent to the Gateway's catalog or quota."
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:199
msgid ""
"Personal model connections are a separate feature on another branch. They"
" plug into `LocalModeGateway(catalog=...)`, the model catalog seam. "
"Running a task end to end in local mode needs that branch; this one does "
"not claim it. Repository, team, profile and other account workflows that "
"need no model are unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-accounts.md:205
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Gateway-only per-request usage views (`/admin/agent/runs/{id}/llm-"
"requests`, `/admin/agent/steps`, and an owner's per-message request "
"detail) answer 503 `gateway_feature_unavailable` in local mode, without a"
" Gateway call."
msgstr ""

